---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Reviews App Terms | One Smile Dental Care"
  description="Purpose and conditions of the One Smile Website Reviews integration."
  breadcrumbs={[{ name: 'Reviews terms', path: '/reviews-terms/' }]}>
  <main class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 py-16 text-stone-700 leading-relaxed space-y-6">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-stone-900">Reviews app terms</h1>
    <p>Last updated: 31 October 2026</p>
    <p>One Smile Website Reviews is operated by One Smile Dental Care to display recent reviews of its own clinic. It is not a service for managing other businesses. Only an authorized clinic owner or manager may connect the clinic's Google Business Profile.</p>
    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-stone-900">Review display</h2>
    <p>Reviews reflect their authors' experiences and are not medical advice or a guarantee of treatment results. The integration selects up to 10 reviews by original posting date, without filtering by rating. Updates depend on Google's API availability and successful website builds. Google remains the source for the complete and current review listing.</p>
    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-stone-900">Account authorization</h2>
    <p>The clinic may disconnect the integration through its Google Account and remove the website's review display. Visitors do not need to authorize an account or pay a fee to read reviews. Connecting the integration does not authorize it to edit listings or respond to reviews.</p>
    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-stone-900">Google and contact information</h2>
    <p>This integration does not imply a partnership with, sponsorship by or endorsement by Google. Google services remain subject to Google's applicable terms and policies.</p>
    <p>For support, contact <a class="text-teal-700 underline" href="mailto:onesmiledentalcare@gmail.com">onesmiledentalcare@gmail.com</a>. See the <a class="text-teal-700 underline" href="/reviews-privacy/">reviews app privacy policy</a> for data access, storage and removal details.</p>
  </main>
</Layout>
